[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7922.47, "timestamp": "02:12:02", "text": "对，对，没错。是啊，我从来没…… 我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7923.99, "timestamp": "02:12:03", "text": "真的非常注意它，但我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7925.91, "timestamp": "02:12:05", "text": "最近在一些动漫里也看到了。我当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7927.75, "timestamp": "02:12:07", "text": "就想，咦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7930.229, "timestamp": "02:12:10", "text": "等等。这是什么意思？我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7931.99, "timestamp": "02:12:11", "text": "觉得这更像是一种老式的表达方式"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7954.87, "timestamp": "02:12:34", "text": "啊，我的游戏好卡。啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7958.87, "timestamp": "02:12:38", "text": "这有点奇怪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7961.51, "timestamp": "02:12:41", "text": "如果我有幻影，我就能干掉他了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7974.229, "timestamp": "02:12:54", "text": "好吧。他是在那边还是在这里？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7979.109, "timestamp": "02:12:59", "text": "那是A点。他应该在轮换，"}]